            "value": "Datasets and code used to produce results described in the manuscript \"Simulated gastrointestinal risk from recreational exposure to Southern California stormwater and relationship to human-associated Bacteroidales marker HF183\". Code uses quantitative microbial risk assessment to estimate risk in stormwater in Southern California using measured bacteria and virus concentrations.",
